# GD-2 (round 19): L §4.2 day_of(y, md), y a year value: day_of(2026, file_by) with file_by = 04-30 is 2026-04-30;
# day_of(2027, 04-30), a month-day literal in an ask (L §7.1), is 2027-04-30.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index yrs = year 2026..2027
input file_by: monthday
input other: monthday


version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  file_by = 04-30
  other = 04-30
ask q: day_of(2026, file_by), day_of(2027, 04-30)
=== expect
q: (2026-04-30, 2027-04-30)
  cut 2026-12-31
